[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5908124162","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/203#issuecomment-5908124162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/203","id":5908124162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABYCbSAg","user":{"login":"Niko1221","id":86886444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODg2NDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86886444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:18:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:18:14Z","body":"Looks right. Could you free the staging buffer and the event, and post a single-GPU A/B on 0.1.27 or newer of the prompt wall time (a 128K prompt, async vs `STRATA_CK_SYNC=1`)? We'll run the resume-equality gate for 0.1.29.","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5908124162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5910017666","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/203#issuecomment-5910017666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/203","id":5910017666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABYEO2gg","user":{"login":"q8atnight","id":229373104,"node_id":"U_kgDODav0sA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229373104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight","html_url":"https://github.com/q8atnight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/q8atnight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T11:13:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T11:13:18Z","body":"Pushed (rebased on 0.1.28): the staging buffer and its event are freed at teardown (a guard on the serve\nscope joins a pending copy-out first), and also on a failed allocation.\n\nThe A/B, honestly: **no measurable difference on a single GPU.**\n0.1.28 + this PR, one RTX 3090, IQ3_S, default settings (auto expert cache, `--kv int8`), fresh prompt of\n140,018 tokens each run (8 mid-prompt checkpoints), prompt wall time (TTFT, 1-token answer):\n\n| | run 1 | run 2 | run 3 | median |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| async (default) | 72.43 s | 72.14 s | 72.20 s | 72.20 s (1,939 tok/s) |\n| `STRATA_CK_SYNC=1` | 72.43 s | 72.15 s | 72.16 s | 72.16 s (1,940 tok/s) |\n\nThe async path is really taken (`STRATA_PREFILL_TIMING=1`: each checkpoint enqueued in 0.1-0.9 ms after\nthe first, which includes the 65 ms pinned allocation) — the synchronous copy just doesn't cost anything\nvisible here any more. Our dual build on top of 0.1.24 shows the same today (51.8 vs 51.7 s at 140K);\nthe ~370 ms idle per checkpoint we measured originally was on our 0.1.20-based build and has gone away\nsince the batched drafter prompt pass. So it no longer earns its complexity on current main — happy for\nyou to close it; or keep it if you'd rather have the copy off the critical path by construction.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5910017666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5910280354","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/203#issuecomment-5910280354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/203","id":5910280354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABYEe4og","user":{"login":"Niko1221","id":86886444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2ODg2NDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86886444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Niko1221/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T11:31:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T11:31:11Z","body":"Thanks for the honest A/B. With no difference on current main (the batched draft-layer pass removed the idle time), we'll close this, as you suggested.","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/comments/5910280354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]